    Render complete multi-plot snapshots at requested size
    
    Flush plot updates and render the current page through the native plot renderer. Preserve viewer constraints, preview mode, and page sizes around the requested output layout. This avoids capturing an incompletely sized scroll-area book. Native build and visual acceptance remain pending.

